{
  "title": "Oven Roasted Slovakian Lemon Skewers",
  "description": "A sweet and crisp Slovakian dish featuring lemons, perfect for a crowd, with a Mediterranean twist. This recipe is a unique and delicious way to enjoy lemons.",
  "cuisine": "Slovakian",
  "diet": [
    "vegetarian",
